and Def.3.1(2), PDF p.4; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 与配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是自然数集合，串索引通过显式配对编码进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>高阶检验的统一性施加于整数编码的串索引关系。每个分量由这些柱集的并给出，因此是开集，测度调用有定义。该接口仍表示 Π¹₁-ML 检验，与避免任意 Π¹₁ 零类的 Π¹₁ 随机性分开。</p>\n<p>本轮核对既有 Chong–Nies–Yu 作者稿 §3、Definition 3.1（PDF 页 4）的整数索引条件；本次修改为显式编码与类型闭合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\#_2$ 与配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。下式的 $S$ 是自然数集合，串索引通过显式配对编码进入 $S$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\#_2$ 与配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。下式的 $S$ 是自然数集合，串索引通过显式配对编码进入 $S$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\#_2$ 与配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。下式的 $S$ 是自然数集合，串索引通过显式配对编码进入 $S$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\#_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\langle n,\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11mltest]] — 高阶 Martin–Löf 测试"}],"outgoing":["aa33e0ea8422ba2a","689c9916fcffb575","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","8e999d59227f4a28"]}